sequenceDiagram
    participant Controller
    participant Supervisor
    participant Worker
    participant Evaluator
    Controller->>Supervisor: Approved task, attempt and persisted fence
    Supervisor->>Worker: Immutable job.json and read-only inputs
    Worker-->>Supervisor: result.json and declared artifact bytes
    alt Valid output within limits and current lease
        Supervisor->>Evaluator: Validated artifacts with digests
        Evaluator-->>Controller: Typed measurements and rule outcome
    else Invalid, stale, or incomplete result
        Supervisor-->>Controller: Typed failure and observed usage
    end
